<title>THAILAND: Shinawatra Satellite yr net drops.</title>
<headline>Shinawatra Satellite yr net drops.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial results for year ending December 31 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		  0.69     vs	  1.44</p>
<p>    Net			 241.21     vs	 466.87</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Shinawatra Satellite, a unit of the Shinawatra Group. It is involved in the communications and broadcasting business.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-6520642</p>
